 "3510d7de-32fd-5111-93cc-455f85f59c80" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250959 1145 "We can evaluate this limit in terms of the constant $c$ using direct substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 1}\\frac{{5}^{x}+c}{{2}^{x}-1} & =\\frac{{lim}_{x\\to 1}({5}^{x}+c)}{{lim}_{x\\to 1}({2}^{x}-1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{{5}^{1}+c}{{2}^{1}-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5+c}{2-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{5+c}{1} \\\\  & =5+c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince we know that the above limit is equal to $4,$ we can equate the above with $4,$ and then solve for $c:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5+c & =4 \\\\ c & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250960 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250961 13194139533785 true] [17592186250960 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533785 true] [17592186250960 1041 "field-1" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250960 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250961 13194139533785 true] [17592186250960 1110 #uuid "80c5c700-664e-540f-8ef2-d94ec6e8a84c" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250961 1034 "-1" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250961 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533785 true] [17592186250961 1111 #uuid "7bd15216-9241-5437-87a5-7aa85fdcab4b" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250963 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1089 "q-339068" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1100 "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to 2}{4}^{x/2}=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1113 #uuid "a67fb5a2-d339-56cf-b965-422c99215cb0" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250962 1145 "We can evaluate this limit using direct substitution, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}{4}^{x/2} & ={4}^{2/2} \\\\  & ={4}^{1} \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533785 true] [17592186250963 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250964 13194139533785 true] [17592186250963 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250965 13194139533785 true] [17592186250963 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533785 true] [17592186250963 1041 "field-1"